      "summary": "根据 key 从 Redis 获取 value，键不存在时返回 null，异常时捕获错误并返回 null。",
      "tags": ["cache", "async", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:MailerServer/redis.js:QueryRedis",
      "type": "function",
