      "type": "function",
      "name": "SetRedisExpire",
      "filePath": "MailerServer/redis.js",
      "lineRange": [63, 72],
      "summary": "向 Redis 写入 key-value 并设置过期时间（秒），用于存储验证码等有时效性的数据。",
      "tags": ["cache", "async", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:MailerServer/server.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "server.js",
      "filePath": "MailerServer/server.js",
      "summary": "MailerServer 的主入口和 gRPC 服务端，监听 50051 端口注册 MailerService.SendMail 处理器，接收 UMSServer 转发的验证码邮件发送请求，并每 10 秒向 StatusServer 发送心跳。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "grpc", "service"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
