      "summary": "gRPC SendMail 处理器，接收邮件地址和验证码，调用 email 模块发送验证邮件，成功返回 Success 错误码，失败返回 Exception 错误码。",
      "tags": ["grpc-handler", "email-notification", "async"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
